  <section id="author-bio" style="padding: 4rem 0; background: #0a0a0a;">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 style="font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 500; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 2rem;">About the Author</h2>
      <div style="background: #111; border: 1px solid #1a1a1a; padding: 2rem;">
        <p style="color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          This ranking was developed by the SDF Clothing team with 27 years of experience in Bangladesh's Ready-Made Garment (RMG) industry. We've witnessed the industry transformation from pre-Accord days through the 2023 reforms and into the current era of sustainability compliance and digital traceability.
        </p>
        <p style="color: #FFFFFF; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
          Our team has worked with over 500 brands across 30 countries, ranging from first-time startup founders to established retail chains. We've navigated the challenges of the 2024 Red Sea shipping crisis, the UFLPA compliance requirements, and the preparation for EU Digital Product Passport implementation.
